      "source": "Simon Willison",
      "title": "Northern Gannet",
      "url": "https://simonwillison.net/2026/Aug/15/sighting-391300422/",
      "published": "2026-08-15T03:22:00+00:00",
      "summary": "Northern Gannet, in Pillar Point Harbor, CA, USThis is Morris.\nMorris is a local celebrity: the only known Northern Gannet (Morus bassanus) in the entire Pacific Ocean.\nHe showed up in the Farallon Islands off the coast of San Francisco 14 years ago. He has since made Pillar Point harbor his home, where he's quite easy to spot: the only white bird with a yellow head, usually hanging out with the smaller black Brandt\u2019s cormorants near the harbor sign visible from the end of the commercial pier.\n    \n    \n        Tags: photography, wildlife, half-moon-bay"
    },
